stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_receive: receive valid beacon_block or data_column_sidecar via gossip
    q_receive --> q_query_el: engine_getBlobsV2(kzg_commitments)
    q_query_el --> [*]: not all blobs retrieved / abort
    q_query_el --> q_convert: all blobs matching kzg_commitments retrieved
    q_convert --> q_import: convert blobs to data columns
    q_import --> q_check_subscription: import data columns (skip blob verification)
    q_check_subscription --> q_publish: subscribed to data_column_sidecar subnet / publish sidecar
    q_check_subscription --> q_update_cache: not subscribed to subnet
    q_publish --> q_update_cache: sidecar published on gossip
    q_update_cache --> [*]: update anti-equivocation cache
